# Sorcery of the North (sandoria 83) accepted by GM, no tome: the quest's xi.treasure.onTrade (bypass type 2) draws its
# outcome from the seeded RNG (math.randomInt(1, 100) against the running rates). A level 32 Thief with Thief's Tools
# (chest level 45: a level penalty of 65, so success 10, failure 75, trap 15 in 100) trades again after each failure
# (each failure takes the tools; the chest's 'traded' flag clears 2 s later, the freeze 4 s later). On this stream:
# draws 1-3 fail (CHEST_UNLOCKED + 1, by name, 2 s later), draw 4 springs the trap (Weakness, CHEST_UNLOCKED + 2, the
# chest moves); the fifth trade is refused for the Weakness (CHEST_UNLOCKED + 3) before any draw.
char zone=Feiyin pos=168.7,-24.0,210.8 job=THF lvl=32
quest Sandoria.SorceryOfTheNorth accepted
item SetOfThiefsTools x12
login
tick 13000
trigger Treasure_Chest                    # the chest's own trigger
trade Treasure_Chest SetOfThiefsTools x1  # draw 1: failure
tick 4500
trade Treasure_Chest SetOfThiefsTools x1  # draw 2: failure
tick 4500
trade Treasure_Chest SetOfThiefsTools x1  # draw 3: failure
tick 4500
trade Treasure_Chest SetOfThiefsTools x1  # draw 4: the trap
tick 4500
trade Treasure_Chest SetOfThiefsTools x1  # weakened: refused, no draw
tick 4500
